{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026美國中期選舉正在投票，改選眾議院全部435席、參議院100席中的35席，以及36州州長。</p><p>這場選舉被視為對總統特朗普2.0的全國「公投」，焦點是民主黨能否重奪國會控制權，制衡白宮。</p><p>逾5700萬人已提前投票。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:42:13.505309+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:07:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.350378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.350378+00:00","content_hash":"c7b55ec09eab67e009b3553fd0a38812790d5c121d0b2c8127f24420e7e73daf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}